{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"That was to be our last name...\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:24:19.173000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738295898903150663","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"Neither of us had a good one, so we came up with one.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:24:48.402000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738296021498462250","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"It's meant to symbolize a few sappy things like freedom and the sky and wisdom.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:26:08.278000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738296356522819594","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I love those things. Fitting. Sorry... about everything.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:27:04.812000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738296593643601962","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"It's alright. We should get some sleep, alright?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:27:59.089000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738296821297709066","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"Wha- What.\" He has trouble getting started. \"Tomorrow. we should sleep.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:28:46.158000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738297018719535144","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"Hm?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:29:02.395000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738297086822580285","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"What happened today?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:29:13.778000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738297134566211604","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"We fought a thing. It took control of me and forced me to choose from three of everyone there who had gathered to fight it. Those three people would have their most important memory consumed.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:30:28.373000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738297447440449586","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"You stepped to the forefront and wouldn't let me choose anyone else. The hero you are...\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:30:57.215000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738297568412434452","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"And I suppose it's a little comforting that we were your most important memory...\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:31:25.700000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738297687887052831","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"The thing made a copy of you and it fought us. You damn near killed a few of us – you always were a sight to behold in battle.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:32:36.466000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738297984701431889","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I forced this pain on you then.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:34:02.157000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738298344115535942","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"But you sacrificed yourself. The last words...\" They begin to weep a little again, \"The last words you said to me... 'I'll see you soon'\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:34:41.054000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738298507261116519","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"You did this to save the others. And now it's our cross to bear together.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:35:07.093000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738298616476729405","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I can take the hit, I am sorry you are in the crossfire.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:36:32.025000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738298972707356674","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I'd rather be in the crossfire with you than without you.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:37:05.754000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738299114177167432","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"It sounds like I really loved you though. I hope we can get there again. For you at the very least.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:37:36.651000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738299243768447010","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"This isn't just for me, okay? And you aren't obligated to stay with me just because I'd die for you, okay?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:38:28.044000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738299459326312520","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"What would you do if I loved someone else then?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T07:39:13.472000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738299649865154623","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
